## How We Work Together

**1. Discovery call.** We discuss your store, your targets, and your current SEO situation. No obligation, no hard sell, just an honest assessment of the opportunity.

**2. Technical audit and strategy.** I crawl your site, audit your platform configuration, analyse your competitors, and deliver a prioritised roadmap. Every recommendation is ranked by effort versus revenue impact.

**3. Implementation.** Depending on your team's capacity, I either implement changes directly, guide your developers through the work, or provide detailed briefs your team can follow. I work alongside designers, developers, and marketing teams without friction.

**4. Measurement and iteration.** Ecommerce SEO is not a one-off project. Markets shift, competitors adapt, and your catalogue changes. I track rankings, organic revenue, and crawl health monthly, adjusting the strategy based on real data.

## What the Work Targets

I do not quote outcomes in advance. Results depend on your starting position, your platform and your competitors. The work aims at:

- More organic revenue from category page rankings.
- Better crawl efficiency: new products are found and indexed sooner.
- Higher click-through rates from rich results driven by correct schema.
- Less cannibalisation: each page ranks for its intended keywords.

I give you an honest assessment of what is achievable before work begins.

